<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en" class="scroll-smooth">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>About Veron Crest | Tours and Travels</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Learn about Veron Crest Tours and Travels, a Nepal-based team for inbound tours and outbound holiday planning.">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.1/css/all.min.css" crossorigin="anonymous">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Playfair+Display:wght@600;700;800&family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700;800&display=swap">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/tailwind.css">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/pages/about.css">
</head>
<body class="bg-sand-50 text-slate-800 antialiased about-page">
  <div class="scroll-progress" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <%- include('partials/navbar', { activePage: activePage }) %>
  <main>
    <section class="page-hero about-hero about-reveal">
      <div class="about-hero-shell">
        <div class="about-hero-grid">
          <div class="about-hero-copy">
            <span class="eyebrow">The Veron Crest story</span>
            <h1>Travel should feel like a <em>beautiful secret.</em></h1>
            <p>We are a small team of destination designers, local fixers and curious people who believe the best journeys are deeply personal.</p>
            <a href="/contact" class="page-button">Talk to a designer <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right"></i></a>
          </div>
          <div class="about-hero-image">
            <img src="/assets/images/about.png" alt="Travellers planning a beautiful journey">
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section class="page-section about-reveal">
      <div class="page-shell story-grid"><div><span class="eyebrow">Our point of view</span><h2>Local knowledge. Thoughtful journeys.</h2></div><div class="story-copy"><p>Veron Crest Tours and Travels is being shaped for travellers who want clear advice, useful local context and a route that fits the way they like to travel.</p><p>From Nepal heritage tours, trekking and wildlife experiences to outbound holidays, each itinerary can be adjusted around dates, interests and budget. Company story and team details are sample copy for now.</p></div></div>
    </section>
    <section class="page-section page-section-tint about-reveal"><div class="page-shell"><div class="section-heading"><span class="eyebrow">What we stand for</span><h2>The details make the difference.</h2></div><div class="value-grid"><article><i class="fa-solid fa-compass"></i><h3>Local perspective</h3><p>Every itinerary is shaped with people who live there, not just people who sell it.</p></article><article><i class="fa-solid fa-sparkles"></i><h3>Quietly exceptional</h3><p>We look for the room, table and view that make a trip feel entirely yours.</p></article><article><i class="fa-solid fa-seedling"></i><h3>Travel with care</h3><p>We choose responsible partners and invest in the communities that welcome you.</p></article></div></div></section>
  </main>
  <%- include('partials/footer') %>
  <script>
    (function () {
      var progress = document.querySelector('.scroll-progress');
      var updateProgress = function () {
        var maxScroll = document.documentElement.scrollHeight - window.innerHeight;
        progress.style.width = (maxScroll > 0 ? (window.scrollY / maxScroll) * 100 : 0) + '%';
      };
      window.addEventListener('scroll', updateProgress, { passive: true });
      updateProgress();

      var items = document.querySelectorAll('.about-reveal');
      if (!('IntersectionObserver' in window)) {
        items.forEach(function (item) { item.classList.add('is-visible'); });
        return;
      }
      var observer = new IntersectionObserver(function (entries, instance) {
        entries.forEach(function (entry) {
          if (entry.isIntersecting) {
            entry.target.classList.add('is-visible');
            instance.unobserve(entry.target);
          }
        });
      }, { threshold: 0.12 });
      items.forEach(function (item) { observer.observe(item); });
    })();
  </script>
</body>
</html>




